{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4902400370001","name":"愛依＆プロデューサー","text":"愛依、渡したいものが──","trans":"爱依，我有东西想给你——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"っと、すまん！\r\n先にいいぞ","trans":"哦，抱歉！\n你先来吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902400370010","name":"愛依","text":"お、マジで？\r\nじゃあお言葉に甘えてっと","trans":"哦，真的？\n那我就不客气了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902400370020","name":"愛依","text":"プロデューサーに\r\n今からチョコ渡すんだけど～……","trans":"我接下来要给制作人\n送巧克力哦～……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902400370030","name":"愛依","text":"ちょい、ついてきて～！","trans":"来，跟我来～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}